    "quote": "For any $\\delta>0$, the total number of samples performed by CSAR with EST1 is at most M= O\\bigg(\\sum_{i=1}^n\\Big(\\frac{1}{\\Delta_i^2}\\log\\frac{n}{\\delta}+\\log\\log\\frac{1}{\\Delta_i}\\Big)\\bigg)"
