   "confidence": "medium",
   "notes": "Paper's n = number of base arms (d), k = subset size (m). Algorithm is (0,delta)-PAC (Lemma 2); the sample bound holds on the good event (prob >= 1-delta), recorded as high probability. Gaps defined differently from standard MAB, hence declared symbol."
  },
